ONCE THE FUEL IS DEPELETED , YOU NEED TO [color=#00F5FF]EJECT[/color] THE PART
[color=#FFD700]BEFORE THE TIMER RUNS OUT[/color].
FUEL DEPLETES [color=#FFD700]CONSTANTLY[/color] AND EVEN MORE WHEN YOU [color=#00F5FF]USE[/color] A PART.

ONCE YOU EJECT, THE PART HAS A [color=#00F5FF]CHANCE TO HIT AN ENEMY[/color]. BUT YOU CAN NO LONGER USE THAT PART AGAIN .

[color=#FFD700]TO COME AT THE TOP , USE YOUR FUEL WISELY SINCE[/color] [color=#00FF66]EVERYTHING IS TEMPORARY[/color]"
